23:["$","p","2",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"The home page tells the same story as a build: as you scroll, a website assembles itself line by line, from the first guide through grid, type and colour to a line of code. In the end, everything collapses into a single button. And whoever picks up the magnifier finds notes in invisible ink."}]]}]
